Permission allow rule (..\..\settings.json): Bash(grep -o '\\.[a-z][a-z0-9-]*-[a-z0-9-]*' surfaces/website.css) has a wildcard before the rest of the command, so it also matches any options inserted at that position and approves them without a prompt. Replace that * with the exact value you mean, or only use * after the subcommand.
